      en: ["One of the largest industrial clusters in the Panama Province.", "Home to major food processing plants and bottling facilities.", "Strategic access to the Corredor Sur (South Corridor).", "Provides thousands of jobs for the residents of East Panama City.", "Significant area for the production of building materials.", "Includes a mix of heavy and light industrial activities.", "Currently transitioning towards more logistics-oriented uses.", "Essential for the distribution of consumer goods in the capital."]
